<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GAIA — Self-Learning Platform for Disease Research</title>
<meta name="description" content="A self-learning platform for computational disease research. Scans genomes, scans the web, and builds knowledge that grows.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css?v=14">
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
    <svg class="hero-bg" viewBox="0 0 1800 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
        <defs>
            <linearGradient id="helixGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#a7f3d0" stop-opacity="0.7"/>
                <stop offset="33%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0.7"/>
                <stop offset="66%" stop-color="#34d399" stop-opacity="0.7"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#60a5fa" stop-opacity="0.7"/>
            </linearGradient>
            <radialGradient id="cellGlow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0.3"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0"/>
            </radialGradient>
        </defs>
        <circle class="cell-pulse" cx="200" cy="150" r="80" fill="url(#cellGlow)"/>
        <circle class="cell-pulse" cx="1600" cy="700" r="120" fill="url(#cellGlow)"/>
        <circle class="cell-pulse" cx="1200" cy="200" r="60" fill="url(#cellGlow)"/>
        <g class="vine-sway" opacity="0.4">
            <path d="M100,900 Q150,700 80,500 Q140,300 100,100" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
        </g>
        <g class="vine-sway" opacity="0.35">
            <path d="M1700,900 Q1650,700 1720,500 Q1660,300 1700,100" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
        </g>
        <g class="helix-flow" transform="translate(900, 450)">
            <path d="M-1200,0 Q-600,-220 0,0 T1200,0" stroke="url(#helixGrad)" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M-1200,0 Q-600,220 0,0 T1200,0" stroke="url(#helixGrad)" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none"/>
        </g>
        <g>
            <circle class="particle" cx="200" cy="200" r="3" fill="#4ade80"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="500" cy="680" r="2.5" fill="#a7f3d0"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="1400" cy="180" r="3" fill="#34d399"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="1650" cy="580" r="2.5" fill="#60a5fa"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="900" cy="100" r="3" fill="#4ade80"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="300" cy="500" r="2.5" fill="#a7f3d0"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="1500" cy="420" r="3" fill="#4ade80"/>
            <circle class="particle" cx="700" cy="780" r="2.5" fill="#60a5fa"/>
        </g>
            <text class="float-label" x="150" y="120" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: #4ade80; opacity: 0.25;">ATCG</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="1450" y="180" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #60a5fa; opacity: 0.2;">exon</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="350" y="620" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #a7f3d0; opacity: 0.2;">intron</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="1250" y="720" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: #34d399; opacity: 0.25;">GC 0.62</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="750" y="780" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #4ade80; opacity: 0.2;">D = 1.16</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="1050" y="140" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #60a5fa; opacity: 0.2;">chr6</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="550" y="200" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 9px; fill: #a7f3d0; opacity: 0.2;">HLA-B</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="1600" y="500" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #34d399; opacity: 0.2;">variant</text>
        <text class="float-label" x="250" y="400" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 9px; fill: #4ade80; opacity: 0.2;">fractal</text>
</svg>

    <div class="eq-layer" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 8%;  left: 5%;">
            H <span class="op">=</span> <span class="op">−</span> Σ <span class="v">p</span><sub>i</sub> <span class="f">log</span><sub>2</sub> <span class="v">p</span><sub>i</sub>
        </span>
        <span class="eq med"    style="top: 15%; left: 72%;">
            D <span class="op">=</span> <span class="f">lim</span><sub>ε→0</sub> <span class="f">log</span> N(ε) <span class="op">/</span> <span class="f">log</span>(1/ε)
        </span>
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 22%; left: 30%;">
            E <span class="op">~</span> c · n<sup><span class="v">H</span></sup>
        </span>
        <span class="eq"        style="top: 30%; left: 82%;">
            <span class="v">P</span>(c | x)
        </span>
        <span class="eq med"    style="top: 38%; left: 8%;">
            E <span class="op">=</span> 4ε[ (σ/r)<sup><span class="n">12</span></sup> <span class="op">−</span> (σ/r)<sup><span class="n">6</span></sup> ]
        </span>
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 44%; left: 60%;">
            w<sub>t+1</sub> <span class="op">=</span> w<sub>t</sub> <span class="op">−</span> η ∇L(w<sub>t</sub>)
        </span>
        <span class="eq large"  style="top: 52%; left: 20%;">
            <span class="v">F</span><sub>1</sub> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="n">2</span> · P · R <span class="op">/</span> (P + R)
        </span>
        <span class="eq med"    style="top: 60%; left: 78%;">
            E <span class="op">=</span> <span class="n">332</span> · q<sub>i</sub> q<sub>j</sub> · e<sup>−κr</sup> <span class="op">/</span> r
        </span>
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 68%; left: 4%;">
            χ<sub>i</sub> <span class="op">←</span> χ<sub>i</sub> <span class="op">+</span> η q<sub>i</sub> <span class="op">+</span> Σ γ<sub>ij</sub> q<sub>j</sub>
        </span>
        <span class="eq"        style="top: 76%; left: 55%;">
            ΔG <span class="op">=</span> ⟨G⟩<sub>bound</sub> <span class="op">−</span> ⟨G⟩<sub>free</sub>
        </span>
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 84%; left: 28%;">
            λ ∈ [<span class="n">0</span>, <span class="n">1</span>]
        </span>
        <span class="eq med"    style="top: 90%; left: 74%;">
            ∂E/∂t <span class="op">→</span> <span class="n">0</span>
        </span>
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 12%; left: 45%;">
            ∫ p(x) dx <span class="op">=</span> <span class="n">1</span>
        </span>
        <span class="eq"        style="top: 65%; left: 40%;">
            <span class="op">∇</span>·F <span class="op">=</span> <span class="n">0</span>
        </span>
        <span class="eq small"  style="top: 48%; left: 88%;">
            Σ<sub>i</sub> q<sub>i</sub> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="n">0</span>
        </span>
        <span class="eq med"    style="top: 3%; left: 55%;">
            ⟨S⟩ <span class="op">=</span> <span class="op">−</span>k<sub>B</sub> Σ p<sub>i</sub> ln p<sub>i</sub>
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="container hero-content">
        <svg class="hero-logo" width="90" height="90" viewBox="0 0 80 80">
            <defs>
                <linearGradient id="logoGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#a7f3d0"/>
                    <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#4ade80"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#34d399"/>
                </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="36" fill="none" stroke="url(#logoGrad)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
            <path d="M28,10 Q52,25 28,40 T28,70" fill="none" stroke="url(#logoGrad)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M52,10 Q28,25 52,40 T52,70" fill="none" stroke="url(#logoGrad)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <line x1="31" y1="18" x2="49" y2="18" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8"/>
            <line x1="34" y1="28" x2="46" y2="28" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8"/>
            <line x1="34" y1="52" x2="46" y2="52" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8"/>
            <line x1="31" y1="62" x2="49" y2="62" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="2.5" fill="#4ade80"/>
        </svg>

        <h1>GAIA</h1>
        <p class="tagline">
            A <strong>self-learning</strong> platform for disease research.
            It reads the genome, reads the web, and grows into something
            that knows more tomorrow than it did today.
        </p>

        <p class="tagline-proof" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--fg-dim); margin-top: -8px; margin-bottom: 28px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">
            In simulation: Ankylosing Spondylitis BASDAI 6.9 &rarr; 1.0 in 12 months. Clinical remission.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-cta">
            <a href="#learning" class="btn btn-primary">How it learns →</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ObviousSatire/GaiaAI" class="btn">View source</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="num static">1.08B</div>
                <div class="label">Variants mapped</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="num" data-count="25000000" data-format="m">0</div>
                <div class="label">Compounds indexed</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="num" data-count="500" data-format="plus">0</div>
                <div class="label">Curated sources</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="num static">C++17</div>
                <div class="label">stdlib only &middot; no deps</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <div class="num static">1 TB+</div>
                <div class="label">Knowledge base</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<section id="what-gaia-is">
    <div class="container-narrow">
        <svg class="divider-leaf" width="60" height="24" viewBox="0 0 60 24">
            <line x1="6" y1="12" x2="54" y2="12" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.4"/>
            <line x1="6" y1="4" x2="6" y2="20" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.7"/>
            <line x1="30" y1="2" x2="30" y2="22" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <line x1="42" y1="6" x2="42" y2="18" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.7"/>
            <line x1="54" y1="4" x2="54" y2="20" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <circle cx="30" cy="12" r="2.4" fill="#4ade80"/>
        </svg>
        <h2>What <span class="accent">GAIA</span> is</h2>
        <p class="lead">
            GAIA is a computational system that reads raw genomes, maps
            the variants it finds, and asks one question: what is this
            sequence actually doing? It does not wait for a hypothesis.
            It derives one from the data.
        </p>
        <p class="secondary">
            The result is a protocol &mdash; a specific set of compounds,
            at specific doses, for a specific person. Not a list of
            targets. A treatment plan.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="learning">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>How it <span class="accent">learns</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">
            Three loops, running continuously. Each one improves the system
            without anyone telling it what to look for.
        </p>

        <div class="learn-flow">

            <!-- Stage 1: DNA scanning -->
<div class="learn-stage">
  <div class="learn-visual">
                    <div class="helix-wrap">
                        <div class="helix">
                            <div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div>
                            <div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div>
                            <div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div>
                            <div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div>
                            <div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div>
                            <div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div><div class="rung"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scan-sweep"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                        <div class="base-pair"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
  </div>
  <div class="learn-copy">
    <span class="stage-badge">Loop 01</span>
    <h3>Reading <span class="accent">raw sequence</span></h3>
    <p>
                                Every region is read for what it can hold. The
                                system finds the sites a natural compound can
                                reach on its own — and the ones that require
                                a covalent bond to stay anchored.
                            </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Scan</strong> the genome for what can be targeted</li>
      <li><strong>Read</strong> each site — reversible or covalent</li>
      <li><strong>Mark</strong> what a natural compound can hold on its own</li>
      <li><strong>Flag</strong> what only a refined molecule could reach</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>



<div class="learn-stage reverse">
                <div class="learn-visual">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
                        <defs>
                            <radialGradient id="synergyGlow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0.22"/>
                                <stop offset="60%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0.06"/>
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0"/>
                            </radialGradient>
                            <radialGradient id="cpdGlow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0.6"/>
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0"/>
                            </radialGradient>
                        </defs>

                        <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="170" fill="url(#synergyGlow)"/>

                        <!-- Central target — layered circles pulsing -->
                        <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="32" fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="46" fill="none" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.5">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="46;62;46" dur="3.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;0;0.5" dur="3.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="62" fill="none" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.3">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="62;82;62" dur="3.6s" begin="-1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.3;0;0.3" dur="3.6s" begin="-1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>

                        <!-- Target label -->
                        <text x="200" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#4ade80" font-weight="bold">target</text>

                        <!-- Compound 1 — top-left, hexagonal organic shape -->
                        <g>
                            <polygon points="88,72 108,84 108,108 88,120 68,108 68,84"
                                     fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.6">
                                <animate attributeName="stroke-opacity" values="0.6;1;0.6" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            </polygon>
                            <text x="88" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#a7f3d0">cpd 1</text>
                            <line x1="108" y1="108" x2="170" y2="172" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 4" opacity="0.5"/>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Compound 2 — top-right, hexagonal shape -->
                        <g>
                            <polygon points="312,72 332,84 332,108 312,120 292,108 292,84"
                                     fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#93c5fd" stroke-width="1.6">
                                <animate attributeName="stroke-opacity" values="0.6;1;0.6" dur="3s" begin="-1s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            </polygon>
                            <text x="312" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#93c5fd">cpd 2</text>
                            <line x1="292" y1="108" x2="230" y2="172" stroke="#93c5fd" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 4" opacity="0.5"/>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Compound 3 — bottom, hexagonal shape -->
                        <g>
                            <polygon points="200,300 220,312 220,336 200,348 180,336 180,312"
                                     fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.6">
                                <animate attributeName="stroke-opacity" values="0.6;1;0.6" dur="3s" begin="-2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            </polygon>
                            <text x="200" y="328" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#60a5fa">cpd 3</text>
                            <line x1="200" y1="300" x2="200" y2="236" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 4" opacity="0.5"/>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Flowing particles into the target (3 streams) -->
                        <circle r="3" fill="#a7f3d0">
                            <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M 88 96 L 200 200"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;1;0" dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="3" fill="#93c5fd">
                            <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-0.8s" path="M 312 96 L 200 200"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;1;0" dur="2.4s" begin="-0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="3" fill="#60a5fa">
                            <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-1.6s" path="M 200 324 L 200 200"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;1;0" dur="2.4s" begin="-1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>

                        <!-- Echo particles (fainter, offset) -->
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.5">
                            <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-0.4s" path="M 88 96 L 200 200"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#93c5fd" opacity="0.5">
                            <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-1.2s" path="M 312 96 L 200 200"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#60a5fa" opacity="0.5">
                            <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-2.0s" path="M 200 324 L 200 200"/>
                        </circle>

                        <!-- Synergy label -->
                        <text x="200" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.8" letter-spacing="3">SYNERGY</text>

                        <!-- Outer ring of faint pulses -->
                        <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="140" fill="none" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2 6" opacity="0.3">
                            <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 200 200" to="360 200 200" dur="40s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="learn-copy">
                    <span class="stage-badge">Loop 02</span>
                    <h3>Combining <span class="accent">what fits</span></h3>
                    <p>
                        Natural compounds are mapped to what they can reach.
                        When two or more hit the same pathway from different
                        angles, they act together — molecular synergy, not
                        single-agent suppression.
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Match</strong> each natural compound to the sites it reaches</li>
                        <li><strong>Combine</strong> compounds that converge on the same pathway</li>
                        <li><strong>Reserve</strong> covalent binding for what must stay anchored</li>
                        <li><strong>Refine</strong> a molecule only when nature falls short</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Stage 3: Continuous loop -->
            <div class="learn-stage">
                <div class="learn-visual">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
                        <defs>
                            <radialGradient id="deliverGlow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#a7f3d0" stop-opacity="0.22"/>
                                <stop offset="60%" stop-color="#a7f3d0" stop-opacity="0.06"/>
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#a7f3d0" stop-opacity="0"/>
                            </radialGradient>
                            <linearGradient id="capsuleGradA" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4ade80"/>
                                <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#a7f3d0"/>
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#93c5fd"/>
                            </linearGradient>
                        </defs>

                        <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="170" fill="url(#deliverGlow)"/>

                        <!-- Outer orbit ring with rotating dots -->
                        <g>
                            <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 200 200" to="360 200 200" dur="45s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <circle cx="200" cy="200" r="150" fill="none" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2 6" opacity="0.4"/>
                            <circle cx="200" cy="50" r="2.5" fill="#4ade80"/>
                            <circle cx="350" cy="200" r="2" fill="#93c5fd"/>
                            <circle cx="200" cy="350" r="2.5" fill="#a7f3d0"/>
                            <circle cx="50" cy="200" r="2" fill="#60a5fa"/>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Central capsule — larger -->
                        <g transform="translate(200 200)">
                            <rect x="-70" y="-26" width="140" height="52" rx="26"
                                  fill="#0e1a14" stroke="url(#capsuleGradA)" stroke-width="2"/>
                            <line x1="0" y1="-26" x2="0" y2="26" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.7"/>
                            <rect x="-66" y="-22" width="132" height="44" rx="22"
                                  fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.08"/>

                            <!-- Two pulses traveling through -->
                            <circle r="3" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.9">
                                <animate attributeName="cx" values="-58;58" dur="2.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;1;1;0" dur="2.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            </circle>
                            <circle r="3" fill="#93c5fd" opacity="0.9">
                                <animate attributeName="cx" values="-58;58" dur="2.6s" begin="-1.3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                                <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;1;1;0" dur="2.6s" begin="-1.3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            </circle>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Top label -->
                        <text x="200" y="40" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.8" letter-spacing="3">FORM + ROUTE</text>

                        <!-- 4 delivery icons at cardinal points -->
                        <!-- Top: pill (two-tone split) -->
                        <g transform="translate(200 95)">
                            <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="24" ry="11" fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <line x1="-24" y1="0" x2="24" y2="0" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="0.8"/>
                            <path d="M -24 0 A 24 11 0 0 1 24 0" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.15"/>
                            <text x="0" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.8">pill</text>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Bottom: capsule split -->
                        <g transform="translate(200 305)">
                            <rect x="-24" y="-11" width="48" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <line x1="0" y1="-11" x2="0" y2="11" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="0.8"/>
                            <path d="M -24 0 A 24 11 0 0 0 24 0" fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.15"/>
                            <text x="0" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.8">capsule</text>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Left: liquid droplet with shine -->
                        <g transform="translate(78 200)">
                            <path d="M 0 -22 Q 16 -4 16 8 A 16 16 0 0 1 -16 8 Q -16 -4 0 -22 Z"
                                  fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#93c5fd" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <path d="M -6 -6 Q -2 -12 0 -14" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.5"/>
                            <text x="0" y="38" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#93c5fd" opacity="0.8">liquid</text>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Right: syringe -->
                        <g transform="translate(322 200)">
                            <rect x="-22" y="-7" width="34" height="14" rx="2" fill="#0e1a14" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <line x1="12" y1="0" x2="28" y2="0" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <line x1="-22" y1="-10" x2="-22" y2="10" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <line x1="-30" y1="0" x2="-22" y2="0" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                            <text x="0" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="#60a5fa" opacity="0.8">inject</text>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Faint delivery paths (arcs connecting icons to capsule) -->
                        <g stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2 4" fill="none" opacity="0.3">
                            <path d="M 200 130 Q 200 165 200 174"/>
                            <path d="M 200 270 Q 200 235 200 226"/>
                            <path d="M 115 200 Q 150 200 130 200"/>
                            <path d="M 285 200 Q 250 200 270 200"/>
                        </g>

                        <!-- Small flowing particles along the arcs -->
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#4ade80">
                            <animateMotion dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M 200 130 Q 200 165 200 174"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;1;0" dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#a7f3d0">
                            <animateMotion dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-0.7s" path="M 200 270 Q 200 235 200 226"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;1;0" dur="2s" begin="-0.7s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#93c5fd">
                            <animateMotion dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-1.3s" path="M 115 200 Q 150 200 130 200"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;1;0" dur="2s" begin="-1.3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle r="1.8" fill="#60a5fa">
                            <animateMotion dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-1.6s" path="M 285 200 Q 250 200 270 200"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;1;0" dur="2s" begin="-1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="learn-copy">
                    <span class="stage-badge">Loop 03</span>
                    <h3>Delivering <span class="accent">the plan</span></h3>
                    <p>
                        A protocol is only as good as its delivery. GAIA
                        chooses the form — pill, capsule, liquid, injection —
                        and builds the full plan around it: what to take,
                        when, and for how long.
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Choose</strong> the form — oral, capsule, liquid, injection</li>
                        <li><strong>Formulate</strong> for stability, absorption, and shelf life</li>
                        <li><strong>Set</strong> dose, timing, and escalation rules</li>
                        <li><strong>Deliver</strong> the plan — what, when, and how</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="math">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>The math <span class="accent">underneath</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">
            Sequence is raw potential. Meaning emerges only when a pattern
            is applied in a context. We wrote the math that reads both —
            not assembled from other people's tools, but derived from the
            structure of the genome itself.
        </p>

        <div class="math-narrative">

            <h3>Boundaries are <span class="accent">where biology shifts</span></h3>
            <p>
                The genome isn't uniform. Composition drifts, structure loosens,
                conservation fades. A boundary is placed wherever those shifts
                align — and the same logic runs at three scales at once.
            </p>

            <div class="equation-stack">
                <div class="equation-row">
                    <div class="equation-label">FINE</div>
                    <div class="equation-body">&Delta;&thinsp;GC &gt; &tau;<sub>fine</sub> &nbsp;&and;&nbsp; &Delta;&thinsp;H4 &gt; &tau;<sub>fine</sub></div>
                    <div class="equation-note">local composition shift</div>
                </div>
                <div class="equation-row">
                    <div class="equation-label">MEDIUM</div>
                    <div class="equation-body">&nabla;&thinsp;CpG<sub>O/E</sub> &gt; &tau;<sub>mid</sub></div>
                    <div class="equation-note">island-scale structure change</div>
                </div>
                <div class="equation-row">
                    <div class="equation-label">COARSE</div>
                    <div class="equation-body">&Delta;&thinsp;PhyloP &gt; &tau;<sub>coarse</sub></div>
                    <div class="equation-note">evolutionary signal break</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3>Every segment earns a <span class="accent">signature</span></h3>
            <p>
                Between boundaries, each region is described not by a label but
                by a fingerprint — its composition, its reading frame, its skew,
                its conservation across deep time. The classifier is not told
                what to look for. It discovers which combinations of features
                separate one kind of region from another, and holds that
                separation across chromosomes and species.
            </p>

            <div class="feature-ribbon">
                <span>Composition</span>
                <span>Structure</span>
                <span>Frame</span>
                <span>Skew</span>
                <span>Conservation</span>
                <span>Context</span>
            </div>

            <p class="math-close">
                No threshold is chosen. The boundaries, the features, and the decision surface are all discovered from labeled sequence — and every equation is written from scratch.
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="ml-physics">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="spectra-visual">

            <div class="spectra-header">
                <p class="spectra-kicker">Physics and machine learning — together</p>
                <h3 class="spectra-title">Two methods. Each one covers what the other <span class="accent">misses</span>.</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="spectra-columns">

                <div class="spectra-col spectra-col-physics">
                    <div class="spectra-col-head">
                        <span class="spectra-col-tag">Physics</span>
                        <span class="spectra-col-sub">can score anything — cannot learn</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="spectra-col-body">
                        <p>
                            Every candidate gets a physical score. Lennard-Jones
                            for contacts, Coulomb for electrostatics, solvation
                            for how the pocket reshapes, entropy for what the
                            ligand loses when it binds. The number is real and
                            the physics is inspectable — but the equations are
                            fixed.
                        </p>
                        <p class="spectra-col-limit">
                            Physics cannot get better at what it does.
                            It does not learn from the compounds it gets wrong.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="spectra-col spectra-col-ml">
                    <div class="spectra-col-head">
                        <span class="spectra-col-tag">Machine learning</span>
                        <span class="spectra-col-sub">can learn anything — cannot explain it</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="spectra-col-body">
                        <p>
                            The same complex is read as a feature vector. The
                            classifier discovers which combinations of features
                            separate binders from non-binders — patterns no one
                            hand-coded, thresholds no one set. Trained on
                            labeled data, it finds what physics alone would miss.
                        </p>
                        <p class="spectra-col-limit">
                            ML cannot justify its decisions. When it disagrees
                            with physics, nobody can say which one is right.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="spectra-visual-wrap">
                <svg class="spectra-svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 440" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
                    <defs>
                        <linearGradient id="mlBaseGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#60a5fa" stop-opacity="0.05"/>
                            <stop offset="50%"  stop-color="#93c5fd" stop-opacity="0.45"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#60a5fa" stop-opacity="0.05"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                        <linearGradient id="curveHighlight" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0"/>
                            <stop offset="50%"  stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0.35"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                        <radialGradient id="agreeGlow2" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#a7f3d0" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0"/>
                        </radialGradient>
                        <radialGradient id="divergeGlow2" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#fbbf24" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f59e0b" stop-opacity="0"/>
                        </radialGradient>
                        <radialGradient id="scoreHalo2" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0.22"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0"/>
                        </radialGradient>
                        <radialGradient id="vignette" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="60%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#000000" stop-opacity="0"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#000000" stop-opacity="0.35"/>
                        </radialGradient>
                        <linearGradient id="peakBright" x1="0%" y1="100%" x2="0%" y2="0%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#4ade80" stop-opacity="0.1"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#a7f3d0" stop-opacity="1"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                        <linearGradient id="peakDim" x1="0%" y1="100%" x2="0%" y2="0%">
                            <stop offset="0%"   stop-color="#334155" stop-opacity="0.1"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#64748b" stop-opacity="0.6"/>
                        </linearGradient>
                    </defs>

                    <!-- soft background field -->
                    <ellipse cx="600" cy="220" rx="580" ry="180" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.02"/>
                    <ellipse cx="600" cy="220" rx="420" ry="120" fill="#60a5fa" opacity="0.025"/>

                    <!-- ambient dust particles drifting slowly across the canvas -->
                    <g fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.35">
                        <circle cx="80" cy="80" r="1.2">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="80;70;80" dur="11s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.6;0.2" dur="7s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="220" cy="340" r="1.1">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="340;330;340" dur="13s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.55;0.2" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="370" cy="70" r="1.3">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="70;60;70" dur="12s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.6;0.2" dur="6.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="510" cy="360" r="1.1">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="360;350;360" dur="14s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.15;0.5;0.15" dur="9s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="640" cy="60" r="1.2">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="60;50;60" dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.6;0.2" dur="7.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="780" cy="355" r="1.1">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="355;345;355" dur="12.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.55;0.2" dur="8.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="920" cy="75" r="1.3">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="75;65;75" dur="11.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.6;0.2" dur="7s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="1050" cy="350" r="1.2">
                            <animate attributeName="cy" values="350;340;350" dur="13.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.2;0.55;0.2" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                    </g>

                    <!-- reference grid, five vertical rules with slow pulse -->
                    <g stroke="rgba(148,163,184,0.07)" stroke-width="1">
                        <line x1="120" y1="60"  x2="120" y2="360">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="9s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                        <line x1="360" y1="60"  x2="360" y2="360">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="9s" begin="-1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                        <line x1="600" y1="60"  x2="600" y2="360">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="9s" begin="-3.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                        <line x1="840" y1="60"  x2="840" y2="360">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="9s" begin="-5.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                        <line x1="1080" y1="60" x2="1080" y2="360">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="9s" begin="-7.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                    </g>

                    <!-- baseline -->
                    <line x1="80" y1="340" x2="1120" y2="340"
                          stroke="rgba(148,163,184,0.25)" stroke-width="1"/>
                    <text x="80" y="358" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                          font-size="9" letter-spacing="0.18em" fill="#475569">BASELINE</text>

                    <!-- y-axis labels -->
                    <text x="55" y="100" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                          font-size="9" letter-spacing="0.18em" fill="#475569"
                          text-anchor="end" transform="rotate(-90 55 100)">PROBABILITY</text>
                    <text x="55" y="320" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                          font-size="9" letter-spacing="0.18em" fill="#475569"
                          text-anchor="end" transform="rotate(-90 55 320)">ENERGY</text>

                    <!-- ============================================
                         ML CURVE — 4 layered strands with highlight
                         ============================================ -->

                    <!-- layer 1: soft diffuse glow -->
                    <g>
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; 0 -4; 0 0; 0 4; 0 0" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        <path d="M 100 300 C 260 220, 400 130, 600 130 C 800 130, 940 220, 1100 300"
                              fill="none" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="24"
                              opacity="0.08" filter="blur(14px)"/>
                    </g>

                    <!-- layer 2: base solid with inner highlight -->
                    <g>
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; 0 -3; 0 0; 0 3; 0 0" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        <path d="M 100 300 C 260 220, 400 130, 600 130 C 800 130, 940 220, 1100 300"
                              fill="none" stroke="url(#mlBaseGrad)" stroke-width="8"
                              opacity="0.4" filter="blur(4px)"/>
                        <path d="M 100 300 C 260 220, 400 130, 600 130 C 800 130, 940 220, 1100 300"
                              fill="none" stroke="url(#mlBaseGrad)" stroke-width="3"/>
                        <!-- thin white highlight along the top edge -->
                        <path d="M 100 297 C 260 217, 400 127, 600 127 C 800 127, 940 217, 1100 297"
                              fill="none" stroke="url(#curveHighlight)" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.5"/>
                    </g>

                    <!-- layer 3: ripple scrolls continuously -->
                    <g>
                        <path d="M 100 312 C 180 292, 260 272, 340 252
                                 C 420 232, 480 192, 560 182
                                 C 640 172, 700 192, 780 212
                                 C 860 232, 940 262, 1020 282
                                 C 1060 292, 1100 302, 1140 304"
                              fill="none" stroke="#93c5fd" stroke-width="1.3"
                              opacity="0.5" stroke-dasharray="2 4"/>
                        <animate attributeName="opacity"
                            values="0.35;0.75;0.35" dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </g>

                    <!-- layer 4: envelope breathes slower -->
                    <path d="M 100 328 C 300 280, 500 200, 600 200 C 700 200, 900 280, 1100 328"
                          fill="none" stroke="#60a5fa" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.3">
                        <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.15;0.5;0.15" dur="5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </path>

                    <!-- ============================================
                         PHYSICS PEAKS — 3 bright (with fill), 5 dim
                         ============================================ -->

                    <!-- bright peaks as filled triangles -->
                    <g class="peak bright" data-idx="0" style="opacity:0">
                        <path d="M 195 340 L 200 165 L 205 340 Z"
                              fill="url(#peakBright)" opacity="0.35"/>
                        <path d="M 200 165 L 200 340"
                              stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.8"/>
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; 0 -6; 0 0" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </g>
                    <g class="peak bright" data-idx="1" style="opacity:0">
                        <path d="M 395 340 L 400 140 L 405 340 Z"
                              fill="url(#peakBright)" opacity="0.4"/>
                        <path d="M 400 140 L 400 340"
                              stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.8"/>
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; 0 -6; 0 0" dur="3s" begin="-1s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </g>
                    <g class="peak bright" data-idx="2" style="opacity:0">
                        <path d="M 795 340 L 800 180 L 805 340 Z"
                              fill="url(#peakBright)" opacity="0.3"/>
                        <path d="M 800 180 L 800 340"
                              stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.8"/>
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; 0 -6; 0 0" dur="3s" begin="-2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </g>

                    <!-- bright peak labels -->
                    <g font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="10"
                       fill="#a7f3d0" text-anchor="middle">
                        <text class="peak-label" data-idx="0" x="200" y="150" style="opacity:0">entropy</text>
                        <text class="peak-label" data-idx="1" x="400" y="125" style="opacity:0">sasa</text>
                        <text class="peak-label" data-idx="2" x="800" y="165" style="opacity:0">gb</text>
                    </g>

                    <!-- 5 dim peaks as thin triangles -->
                    <g stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none">
                        <path class="peak dim" data-idx="3" d="M 280 340 L 285 250 L 290 340" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.35;0.65;0.35" dur="8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </path>
                        <path class="peak dim" data-idx="4" d="M 518 340 L 523 240 L 528 340" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.35;0.65;0.35" dur="8s" begin="-1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </path>
                        <path class="peak dim" data-idx="5" d="M 643 340 L 648 260 L 653 340" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.35;0.65;0.35" dur="8s" begin="-3.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </path>
                        <path class="peak dim" data-idx="6" d="M 903 340 L 908 245 L 913 340" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.35;0.65;0.35" dur="8s" begin="-4.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </path>
                        <path class="peak dim" data-idx="7" d="M 1028 340 L 1033 255 L 1038 340" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.35;0.65;0.35" dur="8s" begin="-6.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </path>
                    </g>

                    <!-- dim peak labels -->
                    <g font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="9"
                       fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle" opacity="0.55">
                        <text x="285" y="240">mmgbsa</text>
                        <text x="523" y="230">fep</text>
                        <text x="648" y="250">qm</text>
                        <text x="908" y="235">water</text>
                        <text x="1033" y="245">mm</text>
                    </g>

                    <!-- bright signal dots above peaks -->
                    <g fill="#4ade80">
                        <circle class="peak-dot" data-idx="0" cx="200" cy="160" r="4" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="3;5.5;3" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle class="peak-dot" data-idx="1" cx="400" cy="135" r="4" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="3;5.5;3" dur="2.5s" begin="-0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="2.5s" begin="-0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle class="peak-dot" data-idx="2" cx="800" cy="175" r="4" style="opacity:0">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="3;5.5;3" dur="2.5s" begin="-1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.5;1;0.5" dur="2.5s" begin="-1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                    </g>

                    <!-- ============================================
                         AGREEMENT & DIVERGENCE
                         ============================================ -->

                    <g class="agree-points" style="opacity:0">
                        <circle cx="200" cy="160" r="16" fill="url(#agreeGlow2)">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="13;19;13" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="400" cy="135" r="18" fill="url(#agreeGlow2)">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="15;21;15" dur="2.5s" begin="-0.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="800" cy="175" r="16" fill="url(#agreeGlow2)">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="13;19;13" dur="2.5s" begin="-1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                    </g>

                    <g class="diverge-point" style="opacity:0">
                        <circle cx="648" cy="260" r="17" fill="url(#divergeGlow2)">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="14;22;14" dur="1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="648" cy="260" r="4" fill="#fbbf24">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="4;6.5;4" dur="1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;0.4;1" dur="1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>
                        <text x="648" y="292" text-anchor="middle"
                              font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                              font-size="9" fill="#fbbf24" opacity="0.9">worth inspecting</text>
                    </g>

                    <!-- ============================================
                         TRAVELING PARTICLES with trails
                         ============================================ -->

                    <circle r="3.5" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.75">
                        <animateMotion dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite"
                            path="M 100 300 C 260 220, 400 130, 600 130 C 800 130, 940 220, 1100 300"/>
                    </circle>
                    <circle r="3.5" fill="#93c5fd" opacity="0.75">
                        <animateMotion dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-3.3s"
                            path="M 100 300 C 260 220, 400 130, 600 130 C 800 130, 940 220, 1100 300"/>
                    </circle>
                    <circle r="3.5" fill="#60a5fa" opacity="0.75">
                        <animateMotion dur="10s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-6.6s"
                            path="M 100 300 C 260 220, 400 130, 600 130 C 800 130, 940 220, 1100 300"/>
                    </circle>

                    <!-- peak-sliding particles with vertical trails -->
                    <g>
                        <line x1="200" y1="340" x2="200" y2="240" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;0.55;0" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                        <circle r="2.5" fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.9">
                            <animateMotion dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite"
                                path="M 200 340 L 200 160 L 200 340"/>
                        </circle>
                    </g>
                    <g>
                        <line x1="800" y1="340" x2="800" y2="250" stroke="#a7f3d0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0">
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0;0.55;0" dur="3s" begin="-1.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </line>
                        <circle r="2.5" fill="#a7f3d0" opacity="0.9">
                            <animateMotion dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-1.5s"
                                path="M 800 340 L 800 180 L 800 340"/>
                        </circle>
                    </g>

                    <!-- ============================================
                         SCORE — with halo, emblem, sigma
                         ============================================ -->

                    <g class="score-readout" style="opacity:0">
                        <circle cx="1120" cy="130" r="90" fill="url(#scoreHalo2)">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="80;105;80" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                            <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.65;1;0.65" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                        </circle>

                        <!-- thin circle emblem -->
                        <circle cx="1100" cy="130" r="46" fill="none"
                                stroke="rgba(74,222,128,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/>
                        <circle cx="1100" cy="130" r="40" fill="none"
                                stroke="rgba(74,222,128,0.15)" stroke-width="0.6"/>

                        <text x="1100" y="90" text-anchor="middle"
                              font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="10"
                              font-style="italic" fill="#64748b">combined</text>
                        <text x="1100" y="140" text-anchor="middle"
                              font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="38"
                              font-weight="500" fill="#f1f5f9">−8.72</text>
                        <text x="1100" y="160" text-anchor="middle"
                              font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                              font-size="9" fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.7">σ = 0.72</text>
                    </g>

                    <!-- side labels drifting slowly -->
                    <text x="30" y="50" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                          font-size="10" letter-spacing="0.28em"
                          fill="#4ade80" opacity="0.9">
                        PHYSICS
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; 6 0; 0 0; -6 0; 0 0" dur="12s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </text>
                    <text x="1170" y="50" text-anchor="end"
                          font-family="ui-monospace, monospace"
                          font-size="10" letter-spacing="0.28em"
                          fill="#60a5fa" opacity="0.9">
                        LEARNED
                        <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate"
                            values="0 0; -6 0; 0 0; 6 0; 0 0" dur="12s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
                    </text>

                    <!-- soft vignette for depth -->
                    <rect x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="440" fill="url(#vignette)" pointer-events="none"/>
                </svg>

                <div class="spectra-legend">
                    <span class="legend-agree">
                        <span class="legend-dot legend-dot-green"></span>
                        Agreement — physics confirms the classifier's confidence
                    </span>
                    <span class="legend-diverge">
                        <span class="legend-dot legend-dot-amber"></span>
                        Divergence — flagged, not promoted
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="spectra-foot">
                When the two methods agree, the score is trusted. When they
                diverge, the compound is flagged — because a disagreement
                between a physical calculation and a learned judgment is
                not noise. It is information.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="evidence">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Evidence across <span class="accent">every layer</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">
            Predictions are checked against three independent kinds of
            evidence — computational, cellular, physiological. A claim
            that survives all three is worth acting on.
        </p>

        <div class="eco-layers">
            <div class="eco-layer">
                <div class="eco-glow eco-glow-green"></div>
                <div class="eco-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" width="100" height="100" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
