        <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M 60 60 L 30 30"/>
        <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;1;0" dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
    </circle>
    <circle r="1.5" fill="#ffffff">
        <animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" begin="-1.2s" path="M 60 60 L 90 90"/>
        <animate attributeName="opacity" values="1;1;0" dur="2.4s" begin="-1.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
    </circle>
</svg>
                </div>
                <div class="eco-body">
                    <span class="eco-tag">In vitro</span>
                    <h3>Cellular</h3>
                    <p>Predictions are compared against real cell-based assays from public literature. Pathway activity, gene expression, and cytotoxicity all feed back into the model.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Cell-line assays</strong> — published screens</li>
                        <li><strong>Pathway response</strong> — signaling under treatment</li>
                        <li><strong>Gene expression</strong> — transcript-level confirmation</li>
                        <li><strong>Cytotoxicity profiles</strong> — safe dose ranges</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="eco-layer">
                <div class="eco-glow eco-glow-mint"></div>
                <div class="eco-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" width="100" height="100" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
    <!-- heart shape -->
